port x11/xdg-desktop-portal-gnome
type port
target @any
reason "xdg-desktop-portal-gnome 47.3 -> 50.0 (GNOME 50); no code walls on DragonFly, libgxdp builds from bundled subproject; FreeBSD tree lags at 47"

file materialize dragonfly/Makefile -> Makefile
file materialize dragonfly/distinfo -> distinfo
file materialize dragonfly/pkg-plist -> pkg-plist
